        "text_key": "depth_line.text",
        "speaker_key": "depth_line.speaker",
        "text": "停一下。把定深打開，讓手鬆一口氣。",
        "speaker": "林督導"
      },
      {
        "id": "light_line",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "voice": null,
        "text_key": "light_line.text",
        "speaker_key": "light_line.speaker",
        "text": "水裡看不清，別急著往前。先開燈。",
        "speaker": "林督導"
      },
      {
        "id": "photo_line",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "voice": null,
        "text_key": "photo_line.text",
        "speaker_key": "photo_line.speaker",
        "text": "阿禾，把這張留著。這是新人的第一張水下照。",
        "speaker": "林督導"
      },
      {
